            <ArticleTitle>Children's allergic diseases and microbial contamination of indoor air--a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>187-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The assessment of exposure to bioaerosols in damp houses of two children who suffered from perennial rhinitis and asthma was performed. The paper presents an approach to the complex (i.e., medical and environmental) treatment of allergic diseases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
